  "heroHtml": "<section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"hero_post_inner\">\n      <div class=\"hero__image\">\n        <img class=\"lazy\" data-src=\"/images/covers/village.jpg\" alt=\"动态规划（三）股票问题系列\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero__post__content\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    \n    <div class=\"col col-6 col-t-12\">\n      <div class=\"image-box\">\n        <img class=\"post-image lazy\" data-src=\"/images/covers/village.jpg\" alt=\"动态规划（三）股票问题系列\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n\n    <div class=\"col col-6 col-t-12\">\n      <div class=\"post-head__box\">\n\n        <div class=\"post__meta\">\n          <span class=\"post__minutes\">\n            \n            \n              8 min read\n            \n            <time class=\"post__date\" datetime=\"2021-09-29T22:29:46+10:00\">Sep 29, 2021</time>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n        <h2 class=\"post__title\">动态规划（三）股票问题系列</h2>\n\n        <div class=\"post__bottom\">\n\n          <div class=\"post__author\">\n            <a href=\"/zh-cn/about/\" aria-label=\"Mortalreminder PT\"><img class=\"post__author-image\" src=\"https://q.qlogo.cn/headimg_dl?dst_uin=2656453168&amp;spec=140&amp;img_type=jpg\" alt=\"Mortalreminder PT's Picture\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"post__bottom-meta\">\n            <a href=\"/zh-cn/about/\" class=\"post__author-link\">Mortalreminder PT</a>\n            \n            <span>in</span>\n            <span class=\"post-tags\">\n              \n              <a href=\"/zh-cn/tags/%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95\" class=\"post__tag\">算法</a>\n              \n              <a href=\"/zh-cn/tags/%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92\" class=\"post__tag\">动态规划</a>\n              \n            </span>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
  "contentHtml": "\n      <ol id=\"markdown-toc\">\n  <li><a href=\"#121-买卖股票的最佳时机\" id=\"markdown-toc-121-买卖股票的最佳时机\">121. 买卖股票的最佳时机</a>    <ol>\n      <li><a href=\"#状态转移方程\" id=\"markdown-toc-状态转移方程\">状态转移方程</a>        <ol>\n          <li><a href=\"#如何表示price_min\" id=\"markdown-toc-如何表示price_min\">如何表示<include src=\"/zh-cn/_f252712fcbe7ba4d351c25b2cafc9addd829608c3e068811fcf34e69c24d5a13.xml\"></include></a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#边界条件\" id=\"markdown-toc-边界条件\">边界条件</a></li>\n        </ol>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"#代码\" id=\"markdown-toc-代码\">代码</a></li>\n    </ol>\n  </li>\n  <li><a href=\"#122-买卖股票的最佳时机-ii\" id=\"markdown-toc-122-买卖股票的最佳时机-ii\">122. 买卖股票的最佳时机 II</a>    <ol>\n      <li><a href=\"#状态转移方程-1\" id=\"markdown-toc-状态转移方程-1\">状态转移方程</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#代码-1\" id=\"markdown-toc-代码-1\">代码</a></li>\n    </ol>\n  </li>\n  <li><a href=\"#714-买卖股票的最佳时机含手续费\" id=\"markdown-toc-714-买卖股票的最佳时机含手续费\">714. 买卖股票的最佳时机含手续费</a>    <ol>\n      <li><a href=\"#状态转移方程-2\" id=\"markdown-toc-状态转移方程-2\">状态转移方程</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#代码-2\" id=\"markdown-toc-代码-2\">代码</a></li>\n    </ol>\n  </li>\n  <li><a href=\"#309-最佳买卖股票时机含冷冻期\" id=\"markdown-toc-309-最佳买卖股票时机含冷冻期\">309. 最佳买卖股票时机含冷冻期</a>    <ol>\n      <li><a href=\"#状态转移方程-3\" id=\"markdown-toc-状态转移方程-3\">状态转移方程</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#代码-3\" id=\"markdown-toc-代码-3\">代码</a></li>\n    </ol>\n  </li>\n  <li><a href=\"#123-买卖股票的最佳时机-iii\" id=\"markdown-toc-123-买卖股票的最佳时机-iii\">123. 买卖股票的最佳时机 III</a>    <ol>\n      <li><a href=\"#思路\" id=\"markdown-toc-思路\">思路</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#代码-4\" id=\"markdown-toc-代码-4\">代码</a></li>\n    </ol>\n  </li>\n  <li><a href=\"#188-买卖股票的最佳时机-iv\" id=\"markdown-toc-188-买卖股票的最佳时机-iv\">188. 买卖股票的最佳时机 IV</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#股票问题的一般通解\" id=\"markdown-toc-股票问题的一般通解\">股票问题的一般通解</a>    <ol>\n      <li><a href=\"#状态转移方程-4\" id=\"markdown-toc-状态转移方程-4\">状态转移方程</a>        <ol>\n          <li><a href=\"#边界条件-1\" id=\"markdown-toc-边界条件-1\">边界条件</a></li>\n        </ol>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n  </li>\n  <li><a href=\"#结束语\" id=\"markdown-toc-结束语\">结束语</a></li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2 id=\"121-买卖股票的最佳时机\"><a href=\"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/best-time-to-buy-and-sell-stock/\">121. 买卖股票的最佳时机</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"状态转移方程\">状态转移方程</h3>\n<p>我们可以用<include src=\"/zh-cn/_4ae19b4d2bc3c911e9c4f02e418695163eab37649dfff0e947dbaa412e5dd95a.xml\"></include>来表示，在前<include src=\"/zh-cn/_fd85aeddf1afb7a4e34e914a38eee6cc4afe05d6f829bba0b5e836d614f4084c.xml\"></include>日我们可以得到的最大利润，那么我们第<include src=\"/zh-cn/_fd85aeddf1afb7a4e34e914a38eee6cc4afe05d6f829bba0b5e836d614f4084c.xml\"></include>日的操作有两种选择：</p>\n\n<div class=\"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight\"><code>1.我们在第i日卖出得到的利润可能比之前的利润（dp[i-1]）更高\n2.我们之前的利润要比现在更高，不用进行任何操作\n</code></pre></div></div>\n\n<p>对于情况1，我们得到状态转移方程<include src=\"/zh-cn/_77ab469489cb5bafd5540b5655eb0e59db9037a422c1072ac330c7939b6333ac.xml\"></include>\n而对于情况2，我们有<include src=\"/zh-cn/_0be1d12b3dab87a52b1e6ac9d6e0d61ad6a2c627fe71f011dd06d9f0466fa7d7.xml\"></include>\n综合两种情况，也就得到此题的状态转移方程：</p>\n\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_a9dfd1427cc5a3cf00a7d81a7069cf4f4845ae8808d429f541252122fd944474.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<p>那么剩下的问题就在于如何表示<include src=\"/zh-cn/_f252712fcbe7ba4d351c25b2cafc9addd829608c3e068811fcf34e69c24d5a13.xml\"></include>。</p>\n\n<h4 id=\"如何表示price_min\">如何表示<include src=\"/zh-cn/_f252712fcbe7ba4d351c25b2cafc9addd829608c3e068811fcf34e69c24d5a13.xml\"></include></h4>\n<p>我们发现，<include src=\"/zh-cn/_f252712fcbe7ba4d351c25b2cafc9addd829608c3e068811fcf34e69c24d5a13.xml\"></include>的计算也是一个无后效性的问题，我们同样可以通过动态规划来求解，用<include src=\"/zh-cn/_09def3b89840e849239ee7fca372448d459e2497a39b516a56eb4305099c1330.xml\"></include>来表示前i日股票的最低价格，则<include src=\"/zh-cn/_09def3b89840e849239ee7fca372448d459e2497a39b516a56eb4305099c1330.xml\"></include>的状态转移方程可以写成：</p>\n\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_09def3b89840e849239ee7fca372448d459e2497a39b516a56eb4305099c1330.xml\"></include> = <include src=\"/zh-cn/_2176c99d00f3f38a71f4a88802c80fab696d58fd20bf1039501a5147e3886b3a.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<p>可能这时候你就要说了，你这不是脱了裤子放屁吗？那我们不妨换一个思维方式，还是上面的状态转移方程不变，<strong>我们用<include src=\"/zh-cn/_87de42120c1c31c2cee9d33d6aa6afc2837f7099234c34a370bbacf056c08df7.xml\"></include>表示前<include src=\"/zh-cn/_fd85aeddf1afb7a4e34e914a38eee6cc4afe05d6f829bba0b5e836d614f4084c.xml\"></include>天手上有<include src=\"/zh-cn/_fc855459fd5cd26d60d6b574b4c3a63627be68f6c0b8a093a1845041e45b7611.xml\"></include>个股票时我们的最大利润。</strong> 这时候你不妨停下来思考一会，该如何写出状态转移方程呢？</p>\n\n<p>联立上面两个转移方程，得到<include src=\"/zh-cn/_87de42120c1c31c2cee9d33d6aa6afc2837f7099234c34a370bbacf056c08df7.xml\"></include>的状态转移方程：</p>\n\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_684c6173fb684c0c9522dc88f4841cee7e4e2c8d0bb7753c7867bcf59a833027.xml\"></include>\n<include src=\"/zh-cn/_02c7f9e54fbe8b48a39bc3387a89360d290fe0b2d1f62a5ca4312d3ea39db85f.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<p>没错，此时的<include src=\"/zh-cn/_13c15356eac1201144d2ae86ab2ace2b349eb191da052269552853a583bf595e.xml\"></include>就是之前我们的开销，用来辅助我们计算第<include src=\"/zh-cn/_fd85aeddf1afb7a4e34e914a38eee6cc4afe05d6f829bba0b5e836d614f4084c.xml\"></include>天的最大利润，也就是<include src=\"/zh-cn/_3babff72d8a14c9e7f36d9150c2110cff742c283a929bdcab9c73da3dd4d17aa.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<h4 id=\"边界条件\">边界条件</h4>\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_728be728c38d5440f46955cb65a7f30f2c53811fc08035142109b9b49e2d98c2.xml\"></include>表示在第0天我们手上有0支股票时的最大利润，因此<include src=\"/zh-cn/_f5ab6fd8a2e3eed13dc82ec2e658b8754c02ac04cbbd551ec6daf85e3b42bcf9.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_fb1dc858a4dae0903f55ba5239f58844462c442fd01fe564c477221c0a78c326.xml\"></include>表示在第0天我们手上有1支股票时的最大利润，因此<include src=\"/zh-cn/_4001019d18e759e41b11e3a815a648257e5022c7bf0d3de88e52872965368be4.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"代码\">代码</h3>\n\n<div class=\"language-cpp highlighter-rouge\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight\"><code><span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"nf\">maxProfit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;&amp;</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n     <span class=\"k\">const</span> <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">MAX</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">100100</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n     <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MAX</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n     <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n     <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">();</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> \n         <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span>\n         <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span>\n     <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div></div>\n<p>篇幅关系，空间复杂度的优化留给读者自己思考，我这里不作展开</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"122-买卖股票的最佳时机-ii\"><a href=\"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/best-time-to-buy-and-sell-stock-ii/\">122. 买卖股票的最佳时机 II</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"状态转移方程-1\">状态转移方程</h3>\n<p>122.题与121.题的不同点在于，122.是可以无限进行购买操作的，相应的，我们的状态转移方程也有所改变。</p>\n\n<p>根据我们第一题的状态转移方程，在第一题里，一但我们前面卖出了股票，下次再想购买股票时，总利润便会变成<include src=\"/zh-cn/_94e7f02c2d55d5bb9bbdaec48667d2a8a26119ac7a21200411fafb6399e04d63.xml\"></include>，但在这道题中，由于我们不再受购买次数的限制，因此我们的利润就可以一直累计下去，如何理解这种累计呢？</p>\n\n<p>在前<include src=\"/zh-cn/_f8c6ba81dfe27d46d45a4f6455727fef4a44599f8234cab654986f117d863885.xml\"></include>天，我们的最大利润达到了<include src=\"/zh-cn/_0e0c1350e064b718fa122ef052d843cbf2212af51b6aa4bf6a99e84eb837bdab.xml\"></include>，而在第<include src=\"/zh-cn/_fd85aeddf1afb7a4e34e914a38eee6cc4afe05d6f829bba0b5e836d614f4084c.xml\"></include>天我们要购入股票，此时的利润就会变为<include src=\"/zh-cn/_e0c93554ca5b6a59ad1022b9811acfededf83b9a40d67c5195bcdf6a7cba4b92.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<p>即<include src=\"/zh-cn/_13c15356eac1201144d2ae86ab2ace2b349eb191da052269552853a583bf595e.xml\"></include>的状态转移方程变为：</p>\n\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_3159b36bb9d4a90220cbb8603122432e7931a3666bf56f2b402d97c1cfe19218.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<p>读者应该也注意到，在我们把状态转移方程分成两部分后，我们对转移方程的解读方式也转变了，这里我再次阐述一遍，<include src=\"/zh-cn/_3babff72d8a14c9e7f36d9150c2110cff742c283a929bdcab9c73da3dd4d17aa.xml\"></include>表示手上没有股票时的最大利润，<include src=\"/zh-cn/_13c15356eac1201144d2ae86ab2ace2b349eb191da052269552853a583bf595e.xml\"></include>表示手上有一枚股票时的最大利润。</p>\n\n<p>综上，状态转移方程为：</p>\n\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_684c6173fb684c0c9522dc88f4841cee7e4e2c8d0bb7753c7867bcf59a833027.xml\"></include>\n<include src=\"/zh-cn/_3159b36bb9d4a90220cbb8603122432e7931a3666bf56f2b402d97c1cfe19218.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<p>边界条件与之前相同。</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"代码-1\">代码</h3>\n\n<div class=\"language-cpp highlighter-rouge\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight\"><code><span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"nf\">maxProfit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;&amp;</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n     <span class=\"k\">const</span> <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">MAX</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">100100</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n     <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MAX</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n     <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n     <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">();</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n         <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span>\n         <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span>\n     <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"714-买卖股票的最佳时机含手续费\"><a href=\"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/best-time-to-buy-and-sell-stock-with-transaction-fee/\">714. 买卖股票的最佳时机含手续费</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"状态转移方程-2\">状态转移方程</h3>\n<p>如果你认真阅读了题714.并理解了题122.那这道题你其实可以直接过的，因为这道题和题122.的不同之处就在于，它在售卖时多了手续费这个固定消耗，因此在决定卖出股票的第<include src=\"/zh-cn/_fd85aeddf1afb7a4e34e914a38eee6cc4afe05d6f829bba0b5e836d614f4084c.xml\"></include>天里，如果收益不足以抵消掉手续费，那我们会选择之前的利润作为最优解，即：</p>\n\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_6ac5ee58ebec9d1c82bb05d44f7e7090e1983c223aa5307b3cb0999bcd87acee.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<p>整体的转移方程表示为：</p>\n\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_6ac5ee58ebec9d1c82bb05d44f7e7090e1983c223aa5307b3cb0999bcd87acee.xml\"></include>\n<include src=\"/zh-cn/_3159b36bb9d4a90220cbb8603122432e7931a3666bf56f2b402d97c1cfe19218.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<p>边界条件仍与之前相同</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"代码-2\">代码</h3>\n\n<div class=\"language-cpp highlighter-rouge\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight\"><code><span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"nf\">maxProfit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;&amp;</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">fee</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n     <span class=\"k\">const</span> <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">MAX</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">100100</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n     <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MAX</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n     <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n     <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">();</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n         <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">fee</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n         <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span>\n     <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"309-最佳买卖股票时机含冷冻期\"><a href=\"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/best-time-to-buy-and-sell-stock-with-cooldown/\">309. 最佳买卖股票时机含冷冻期</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"状态转移方程-3\">状态转移方程</h3>\n<p>这道题的变化在于，之前我们只有<include src=\"/zh-cn/_19f2d5bc7ff9aa43fc720b9250d3c497e236857927167bbc5dd09571abc99535.xml\"></include>卖出、<include src=\"/zh-cn/_3f217a4a40f045b6e5f54d27c9f939f6abc4c09530c0529a27c60cf82aa4b270.xml\"></include>买入两种状态，但这道题引入了一个新的新的状态<include src=\"/zh-cn/_0118503cf8cf9ebf7a9e6ba3c5bac5f220b7aeec16e89a762102a636f5c23dce.xml\"></include>冷冻期，而这个冷冻期状态是在卖出操作后出现，如果我们用<include src=\"/zh-cn/_1d3912a8e1ff980ef3373407c57748cdb5885331cce09dce812ee630c5100d93.xml\"></include>来表示当我们在第<include src=\"/zh-cn/_fd85aeddf1afb7a4e34e914a38eee6cc4afe05d6f829bba0b5e836d614f4084c.xml\"></include>天的冷冻期收益，则<include src=\"/zh-cn/_1d3912a8e1ff980ef3373407c57748cdb5885331cce09dce812ee630c5100d93.xml\"></include>可以用<include src=\"/zh-cn/_3b1bdf7e54773eabdc1eb97adda61be7e9b0333347d580248ca25b82684da7e5.xml\"></include>表示为：</p>\n\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_8a86b1df2c96ce734fe77d4016331b74705975c6a19c24e22735ef0b89b7e708.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<p>买入状态的转移方程也有所变化，因为此题中买入状态必须由冷冻期状态进入，也就是：</p>\n\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_2dceb465a2efb198c145244c40e0bc8df8907a305d6c9d4df054e790e486a61c.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<p>最后，综合三式就可以得到我们新的状态转移方程：</p>\n\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_8564f11583273caf18ff015ea7d98ee9beec28ef2d72dcb163835fe22699392a.xml\"></include>\n<include src=\"/zh-cn/_2dceb465a2efb198c145244c40e0bc8df8907a305d6c9d4df054e790e486a61c.xml\"></include>\n<include src=\"/zh-cn/_945fbc5ad67973922fa9337e5db80922e31b4764d76e2c01adc8073f28c64650.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<p>边界条件仍然不变</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"代码-3\">代码</h3>\n\n<div class=\"language-cpp highlighter-rouge\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight\"><code><span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"nf\">maxProfit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;&amp;</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n     <span class=\"k\">const</span> <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">MAX</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">100100</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n     <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MAX</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n     <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n     <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">();</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n         <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span>\n         <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span> <span class=\"c1\">//</span>\n         <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n     <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"123-买卖股票的最佳时机-iii\"><a href=\"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/best-time-to-buy-and-sell-stock-iii/\">123. 买卖股票的最佳时机 III</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"思路\">思路</h3>\n<p>如果没有前面的铺垫直接来看这道题，难度瞬间就高起来了。但现在带着前面的经验再来对比这道题，我们会发现这道题和题121. 题122.有着很大的关联。</p>\n\n<p>假设在第<include src=\"/zh-cn/_fd85aeddf1afb7a4e34e914a38eee6cc4afe05d6f829bba0b5e836d614f4084c.xml\"></include>天卖出了股票，当我们是第一次或第二次操作时，我们的利润是可以积累的。但如果是在第三次操作，那么我们就要重新累计利润了。</p>\n\n<p>我们不妨将<include src=\"/zh-cn/_3b1bdf7e54773eabdc1eb97adda61be7e9b0333347d580248ca25b82684da7e5.xml\"></include>升到三维数组，用第三维来区分第一次操作和第二次操作，即得到代码如下：</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码-4\">代码</h3>\n\n<div class=\"language-cpp highlighter-rouge\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight\"><code><span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"nf\">maxProfit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;&amp;</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">const</span> <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">MAX</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">100100</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MAX</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">();</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"p\">){</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div></div>\n<p>这个代码并不优雅，但对于问题的解决无疑是直接而有效的</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"188-买卖股票的最佳时机-iv\"><a href=\"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/best-time-to-buy-and-sell-stock-iv/\">188. 买卖股票的最佳时机 IV</a></h2>\n\n<p>当问题扩充到<include src=\"/zh-cn/_67fc9a7f9ec57b54685c86704924f20a56ac184bd165b089b71cda2f24af2999.xml\"></include>时，我们解决题123.的思路仍然有效，我们可以用初始化边界为<include src=\"/zh-cn/_b365ff8a99bd5aa643a0583a9a901d317cf7f676cf84572090b59bdff7fdb589.xml\"></include>，再用一个<include src=\"/zh-cn/_447b567bef13831f0efa29854fe68e7af88b04c6fc766cd68fc77c73d6553f9c.xml\"></include>循环写出结果。</p>\n\n<div class=\"language-cpp highlighter-rouge\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight\"><code> <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"nf\">maxProfit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;&amp;</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">empty</span><span class=\"p\">())</span> <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"nb\">NULL</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">const</span> <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">MAX</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1100</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MAX</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">110</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">j</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"n\">j</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;=</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">();</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span>  <span class=\"n\">j</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"n\">j</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;=</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span> <span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">dp</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">prices</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"股票问题的一般通解\">股票问题的一般通解</h2>\n<h3 id=\"状态转移方程-4\">状态转移方程</h3>\n<p>股票问题的三个限定条件是</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>当前天数<include src=\"/zh-cn/_fd85aeddf1afb7a4e34e914a38eee6cc4afe05d6f829bba0b5e836d614f4084c.xml\"></include></li>\n  <li>手持股票<include src=\"/zh-cn/_fc855459fd5cd26d60d6b574b4c3a63627be68f6c0b8a093a1845041e45b7611.xml\"></include></li>\n  <li>允许的最大操作次数<include src=\"/zh-cn/_67fc9a7f9ec57b54685c86704924f20a56ac184bd165b089b71cda2f24af2999.xml\"></include></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>我们设在第<include src=\"/zh-cn/_fd85aeddf1afb7a4e34e914a38eee6cc4afe05d6f829bba0b5e836d614f4084c.xml\"></include>天，手持股票为<include src=\"/zh-cn/_fc855459fd5cd26d60d6b574b4c3a63627be68f6c0b8a093a1845041e45b7611.xml\"></include>，操作次数为<include src=\"/zh-cn/_67fc9a7f9ec57b54685c86704924f20a56ac184bd165b089b71cda2f24af2999.xml\"></include>时我们的利润为<include src=\"/zh-cn/_a84d7927f057b333c3ca0db97203bdcd7c12baf36f0d163d1e7ae5a6fad83fe1.xml\"></include>，视每次购买股票为进行一次操作，则我们的状态转移方程为：</p>\n\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_b321a1ec6044535ee0dc78cedcca5bd23397997c787e909570290e02e71cd7f3.xml\"></include>\n<include src=\"/zh-cn/_3b64445abbd549778cb54479885c3aff44b9a9162a99e9fb71275aeb6917e64f.xml\"></include></p>\n\n<h4 id=\"边界条件-1\">边界条件</h4>\n<p><include src=\"/zh-cn/_e53844e3024c4f6d88abf2455bf001c1ee7b217a94ffb7f3a99cc15a72defd6d.xml\"></include>\n其余值都为0</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"结束语\">结束语</h2>\n<p>股票问题系列和打家劫舍系列的不同点在于，股票问题的每一个系列问题都对状态转移方程进行了改动。面临一道动态规划问题时，要想迅速找到子问题并写出状态转移方程，关键还是要多了解不同的动归题型。</p>\n\n    ",
